<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0256_P01R0102_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">OK!\nYou must be the last passenger.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0256_P01R0102_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Huh?\nDoesn’t seem like the ship will be moving\fanytime soon.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0256_P01R0102_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">If I manage to come back safely from\nthis journey and take my first steps in\fOlivine City, will you live there with me?\rPlease! I beg you!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0256_P01R0102_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">He’s only a crewman of a\npleasure cruise.\fHe has a way of exaggerating things.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0256_P01R0102_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Sabrina: Out of the blue...\nI get the urge to see the ocean...\rIt may be fun to exchange numbers\nwith you...\rDo you want mine? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0256_P01R0102_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} registered Sabrina\nin the Pokégear!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0256_P01R0102_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Sabrina: I think I can keep my promises\nif you call me on Sundays around noon.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0256_P01R0102_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Sabrina: I see...\nI thought you’d make a good friend.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0256_P01R0102_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Sabrina: Now you want to know\nmy number?\fI can see it in your eyes... {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0256_P01R0102_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Sabrina: It’s you...\rHow about a picture here\nagainst the pleasant sea breeze? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0256_P01R0102_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Sabrina: Are you ready?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0256_P01R0102_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Sabrina: I think it looks good.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0256_P01R0102_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Sabrina: I see...\nI thought you’d make a good\fpicture subject...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0256_P01R0102_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Your Photo Album is full.\rAccess your PC and delete\nsome pictures.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0256_P01R0102_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Harbor Master: All boats are grounded!\rThat storm is getting worse by the minute.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0256_P01R0102_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Misty: That settles it.\rWe wait here until the weather clears.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0256_P01R0102_00016" index="16">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ash: The invitation said New Island.\rIf the other Trainers are going, we are not turning back now.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0256_P01R0102_00017" index="17">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Brock: Pikachu agrees with Ash.\rThat makes two votes for the terrible idea.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0256_P01R0102_00018" index="18">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Thunder rolls over the harbor.\rYou head out before anyone can stop you.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0256_P01R0102_00019" index="19">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The storm is gone.\rMorning light stretches across the harbor as if the night never happened.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0256_P01R0102_00020" index="20">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Misty: I know we went somewhere.\rI just cannot remember where.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0256_P01R0102_00021" index="21">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Brock: Whatever happened, everyone made it back safely.\rMaybe that is enough for today.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0256_P01R0102_00022" index="22">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ash looks toward the clearing sky.\rFor a second, a tiny shape seems to drift between the clouds.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0256_P01R0102_00023" index="23">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The road continues.\rSomewhere far away, another journey is already beginning.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0256_P01R0102_00024" index="24">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Harbor Master: A strange route has opened across the water.\rReturn to New Island for another challenge? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0256_P01R0102_00025" index="25">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Harbor Master: Then hold on tight.\rThe sea is calm today, but that island never feels ordinary.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0256_P01R0102_00026" index="26">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Harbor Master: No problem.\rThe boat will be here whenever you are ready.</language>
	</row>
</body>
